    "removed_memory_state_rows": "an independent audit found that the memory manipulation had no causal path: the second domain buffer is empty at the domain switch and the first domain buffer is not representable in the second domain, so the two memory_state rows were duplicates of the shared core row whose only difference came from a shifted random stream. Both rows are removed rather than reinterpreted.",
